# EchoIRCompatibility.v, EchoIRForwardSimulation.v,
# EchoIRBackwardSimulation.v, and EchoIRProgramExamples.v are retained as
# migration history but are not built. Their exact-state agreement statement
# predates certificate removal: the historical start transition stores a
# caller-supplied neighbor permutation, while the maintained IR deliberately
# stores the configuration-owned order. The states are therefore not equal.
